 **VI.4 — The auditor is not the actor.** Those who audit the ledger must hold no standing to append to it during the audit window (§0.1). An auditor who can also write is not a check; it is the capture §0.5 exists to prevent.
 
+**VI.5 — No smoothing.** The Record keeps every event raw and equal. Any summary is a view, recomputable from the Record and never stored in its place. Every view shows its extremes beside its center, and what lies outside the expected is surfaced first, never trimmed.
